      "text": "Regard not them that have familiar spirits, Lev. 19:31. soul that turneth after … familiar spirits, Lev. 20:6. hath a familiar spirit … shall surely be put to death, Lev. 20:27. charmer, or a consulter with familiar spirits, Deut. 18:11. evil spirit from God was upon Saul, 1 Sam. 16:23. said Saul … Seek me a woman that hath a familiar spirit, 1 Sam. 28:7 (28:3–14). dealt with familiar spirits and wizards, 2 Kgs. 21:6 (2 Chr. 33:6). workers with familiar spirits … did Josiah put away, 2 Kgs. 23:24. Saul died … asking counsel of one that had a familiar spirit, 1 Chr. 10:13. trouble, by sending evil angels among them, Ps. 78:49. Seek unto them that have familiar spirits, Isa. 8:19.",
